# Line endings are LF everywhere: the repo moved from a Windows laptop
# (core.autocrlf=true) to Ubuntu on 2026-09-05 and must check out identically
# on both. Binary types listed explicitly so autodetection can never misfire.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.aab binary
*.apk binary
*.keystore binary
*.p8 binary
*.pyc binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
